{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"21":"Funerals (Kitab Al-Jana'iz)"},"section_detail":{"21":{"hadithnumber_first":3089,"hadithnumber_last":3241,"arabicnumber_first":3089,"arabicnumber_last":3241,"name_native":"كتاب الجنائز"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3223,"arabicnumber":3223,"text":"حدثنا قتيبة بن سعيد، حدثنا الليث، عن يزيد بن ابي حبيب، عن ابي الخير، عن عقبة بن عامر، ان رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم خرج يوما فصلى على اهل احد صلاته على الميت ثم انصرف","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih Bukhari (6426) Sahih Muslim (2296)"}],"reference":{"book":21,"hadith":135}}]}